@* D-443 (NCA finding) — starts the token-driven session-expiry guard for the
   signed-in shell. The JS module (session-timeout.js) silently refreshes the
   short-lived access token while the user is active and shows a countdown
   "Stay signed in / Sign out" modal once they are idle. Renders nothing; the
   modal is built by the JS on document.body. *@
@implements IAsyncDisposable
@using System.Globalization
@using Microsoft.JSInterop
